---
import BaseLayout from '../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import PageIntro from '../../components/PageIntro.astro';
import Services from '../../components/Services.astro';
import CTA from '../../components/CTA.astro';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Solutions"
  description="Bespoke web applications, SAP Business One and Produmex integrations, and connected quality control. Software shaped around your workflow."
>
  <PageIntro
    label="What we build"
    title="Build what’s missing. Connect what matters."
    description="A spreadsheet that became a process. A handoff that still needs an email. A task your ERP almost supports. Start with the work that needs a better home."
  />
  <section class="section service-area">
    <div class="wrap">
      <Services />
    </div>
  </section>
  <section class="section studio-section">
    <div class="wrap editorial-split">
      <h2>
        Start with a workflow.
        <br />
        Build a useful first step.
      </h2>
      <div class="prose">
        <p>
          We look at the process with the people who do the work. What data do
          they need? Where does it live? What should happen when they finish?
        </p>
        <p>
          That becomes a focused scope: the application, its connections, and
          the conditions it needs to handle. Deployment and ongoing support are
          agreed around the actual environment.
        </p>
        <p>
          You work directly with Tom, from understanding the problem through
          building the solution.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
  <CTA />
</BaseLayout>
